WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.329
ALEX: Or it's what you say when you want
the money and the

00:00:02.329 --> 00:00:04.658
ALEX: steering wheel.

00:00:04.723 --> 00:00:06.283
JAMIE: Both things can be true at once.

00:00:06.463 --> 00:00:07.795
RUFUS: Welcome to the IPO.

00:00:08.008 --> 00:00:12.278
ALEX: There's also the question of who
the selling stockholders are. The
announcement

00:00:12.278 --> 00:00:16.548
ALEX: says some shares are sold by
selling stockholders, not just Anthropic
itself.

00:00:16.658 --> 00:00:20.214
RUFUS: Which means some existing
stockholders are selling at eighty-three
dollars. That's not

00:00:20.214 --> 00:00:23.771
RUFUS: a scandal — it's how venture
capital works — but it does

00:00:23.771 --> 00:00:27.327
RUFUS: tell you something about who
believed in Anthropic at what price.
